      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIG MAKO (6) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 400m behind Cream (23.57) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Worth another chance. ASTON MONSOON (4) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (26.27) over 460m at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Winning chance. BUB WHO (3) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (23.36) at Warragul. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ROTHWELL JACK (7) hit the frame latest (19.86) when second at Healesville in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Already a winner from this draw.",
